---
import SectionContainer from "./SectionContainer.astro"
import TitleSection from "./TitleSection.astro"
---

<SectionContainer id="por-que-elegirme">
  <TitleSection>
    <svg class="size-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path>
    </svg>
    Por Qué Elegirme
  </TitleSection>

  <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">
    La combinación única de experiencia práctica, investigación académica y certificaciones oficiales 
    que hacen la diferencia en proyectos críticos.
  </p>

  <div class="grid gap-6 mt-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <!-- Investigador Publicado -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-yellow-50 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-200 dark:from-amber-900/20 dark:to-yellow-900/20 dark:border-amber-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-full dark:bg-amber-900/30">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100">
            Investigador Publicado Internacionalmente
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Autor en <strong class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">Springer Nature</strong> (IBIMA 2024, Madrid) 
            sobre modelos de IA para previsión de ventas y toma de decisiones. 
            Validación académica de expertise en AI/ML.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 15+ Certificaciones -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 dark:from-blue-900/20 dark:to-cyan-900/20 dark:border-blue-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-full dark:bg-blue-900/30">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100">
            15+ Certificaciones Oficiales Oracle
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Certificado en NetSuite (3), Oracle Fusion Cloud (4), OCI (2), AWS, 
            Google Cloud y más. Credenciales oficiales que validan expertise técnico 
            en múltiples plataformas cloud y desarrollo de software.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Industrias Reguladas -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-green-50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 dark:from-emerald-900/20 dark:to-green-900/20 dark:border-emerald-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 rounded-full dark:bg-emerald-900/30">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-100">
            Experiencia en Industrias Reguladas
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Sector salud (Biomont) con integraciones <strong class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">HL7</strong> 
            y estándares de compliance. Implementación de soluciones que cumplen 
            requisitos regulatorios estrictos de sectores críticos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Código Limpio -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 dark:from-purple-900/20 dark:to-pink-900/20 dark:border-purple-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-full dark:bg-purple-900/30">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 dark:text-purple-100">
            Código Limpio & Escalable
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Aplicación de <strong class="text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400">Clean Architecture</strong>, 
            principios SOLID y mejores prácticas de DevOps. Código mantenido, 
            documentado y preparado para escalar con el negocio.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Versatilidad Técnica -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-amber-50 rounded-xl border border-orange-200 dark:from-orange-900/20 dark:to-amber-900/20 dark:border-orange-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-full dark:bg-orange-900/30">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-100">
            Versatilidad Técnica Integral
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Full-stack expertise: <strong class="text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400">NetSuite + DevOps + Backend + AI/ML</strong>. 
            Capacidad para cubrir todo el ciclo de vida de desarrollo, desde 
            arquitectura hasta implementación y optimización.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Soporte Continuo -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-rose-50 rounded-xl border border-pink-200 dark:from-pink-900/20 dark:to-rose-900/20 dark:border-pink-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-pink-100 rounded-full dark:bg-pink-900/30">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-pink-900 dark:text-pink-100">
            Soporte Continuo & Actualización
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Mantenimiento constante de certificaciones y aprendizaje de nuevas 
            tecnologías. Compromiso con la excelencia técnica y la mejora continua 
            para entregar soluciones de vanguardia.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionContainer>